= Two demos side by side

<div class="pair">
<div>
demo::../_demo/index.html?normals=exact(.live #left)
img::../_demo/poster.png(.still)
<p>Exact normals</p>
</div>
<div>
demo::../_demo/index.html?normals=plane(.live #right)
img::../_demo/poster.png(.still)
<p>Normals of the plane</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="controls">
<p>Amplitude <input type="range" data-demo="#left, #right" data-demo-input="ampl" min="0" max="0.15" step="0.005">
<span class="value" data-demo="#left" data-demo-value="ampl" data-digits="3"></span>
<button data-demo="#left, #right" data-demo-set="restart">Restart both</button></p>
</div>
